{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "123", "x": 0.8959551137550246, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03778813484861114, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of their personal and professional relationship were recorded in Stieglitz's", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12334338960510077, "w": 0.8261856780226381, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "celebrated black-and-white portraits of O'Keeffe, taken over the course of twenty", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1436641300790535, "w": 0.826573940022697, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "years (1917-37).", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.16398487055300617, "w": 0.16412227925685402, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "By the mid-1920s, O'Keeffe was recognized as one of America's most important", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.19424346276951368, "w": 0.8262381707989862, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and successful artists, widely known for the architectural pictures that", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.21471252375881908, "w": 0.8260551637564446, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "dramatically depict the soaring skyscrapers of New York. But most often, she", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23503326423277177, "w": 0.8267433112463826, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "painted botanical subjects, inspired by annual trips to the Stieglitz family summer", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.25550232522207716, "w": 0.8263166023886469, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "home. In her magnified images depicting flowers, begun in 1924, O'Keeffe brings", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2758601835462605, "w": 0.8258811789098378, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the viewer right into the picture.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.29618092402021323, "w": 0.330268221683146, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Enlarging the tiniest details to fill an entire metre-wide canvas emphasized their", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3264394973760245, "w": 0.8265123225254603, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "shapes and lines and made them appear abstract. Such daring compositions", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.34690855836532986, "w": 0.8259896503109633, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "helped establish O'Keeffe's reputation as an innovative modernist.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.36722929883928257, "w": 0.6772580839131889, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "In 1929, O'Keeffe made her first extended trip to the state of New Mexico. It was", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3974879287771826, "w": 0.8268582417195978, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "a visit that had a lasting impact on her life, and an immediate effect on her work.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4178086692511353, "w": 0.8258162806140794, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Over the next two decades she made almost annual trips to New Mexico, staying", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4382777302404407, "w": 0.8260768990466512, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "up to six months there, painting in relative solitude, then returning to New York", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.45859847071439336, "w": 0.825859546144585, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "each winter to exhibit the new work at Stieglitz's gallery. This pattern continued", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.47909223921579336, "w": 0.8260613152536729, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "until she moved permanently to New Mexico in 1949.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4994129796897461, "w": 0.5397354169274645, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "There, O'Keeffe found new inspiration: at first, it was the numerous sun-bleached", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5296716096276461, "w": 0.8268012378452823, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "bones she came across in the state's rugged terrain that sparked her imagination.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5499923501015987, "w": 0.8266621114829691, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Two of her earliest and most celebrated Southwestern paintings exquisitely", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5704614110909042, "w": 0.826185780547592, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "reproduce a cow skull's weathered surfaces, jagged edges, and irregular", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5907821515648569, "w": 0.8260116931760313, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "openings. Later, she also explored another variation on this theme in her large", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6111028920388096, "w": 0.826858651819413, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "series of Pelvis pictures, which focused on the contrasts between convex and", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6315719907495074, "w": 0.8260553688063522, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "concave surfaces, and solid and open spaces.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6518926557806751, "w": 0.46535525460380617, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "However, it was the region's spectacular landscape, with its unusual geological", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6821883658474134, "w": 0.8260771040965588, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "formations, vivid colours, clarity of light, and exotic vegetation, that held the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7026574268367187, "w": 0.8264849483627944, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "artist's imagination for more than four decades. Often, she painted the rocks,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7229781673106714, "w": 0.8261204721520182, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "cliffs, and mountains in striking close-up, just as she had done with her botanical", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7432989077846242, "w": 0.8261760406769805, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "subjects.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7637679687739295, "w": 0.09639400001414844, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "O'Keeffe eventually owned two homes in New Mexico - the first, her summer", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.794026560990437, "w": 0.8266223318008928, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "retreat at Ghost Ranch, was nestled beneath 200-metre cliffs, while the second,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8143473769071747, "w": 0.8264439383812725, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "used as her winter residence, was in the small town of Abiquiu. While both locales", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8346680419383424, "w": 0.8261643528322468, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "provided a wealth of imagery for her paintings, one feature of the Abiquiu house -", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8551618481611349, "w": 0.8268583442445515, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the large walled patio with its black door - was particularly inspirational. In more", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8754825886350877, "w": 0.8264671090208323, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "than thirty pictures between 1946 and 1960, she reinvented the patio into an", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.895951649624393, "w": 0.8260988393867654, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "abstract arrangement of geometric shapes.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9162723900983457, "w": 0.4462059000445266, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}